{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13212140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13212140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1321214001:0":{"text":"안돼! 내가 한 달 동안이나 그린 그림이라고!","source_cn":"不！这幅画我画了整整一个月！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C8D2B095A0F322E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::0":{"text":"훼손된 그림","source_cn":"被弄花的画作","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C5D868438995C19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321214002:1":{"text":"아... 조금 전에 작은 눈사람이 액자를 건드린 것 같아.","source_cn":"啊……小雪人好像刚刚撞倒了画框。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAF9EDE7C47BAA70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321214003:1":{"text":"미안해요... 얼룩이 진 것 같은데 다른 걸 그려서 보완해 보는 건 어떨까요?","source_cn":"对不起呀……好像蹭到了点色块，画点什么补救一下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB01F9E015C790B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321214004:1":{"text":"역시 완벽한 작품을 그리는 건 무리였어...","source_cn":"我果然画不出完美的作品……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ADF5C23D55218AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321214005:1":{"text":"다시 그릴까...","source_cn":"要不重新开始……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6EF2ADDEF7DB516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321214006:1":{"text":"더 이상은 못 들어주겠네!","source_cn":"咱都听不下去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3018A400004EDFBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321214007:1":{"text":"으악... 갑자기 말을...! 깜짝 놀랐잖아!","source_cn":"噫——你怎么突然开口说话！吓死我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x528A750A2960E412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321214008:1":{"text":"이, 이게 뭐지! 내가 미친 건가? 눈사람이 말을 하다니?","source_cn":"这、这是什么！是我疯了吗？雪人在说话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FC50EC34D0CBF00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321214009:1":{"text":"너! 그래, 바로 너! 붓을 들고 있는 너 말이야!","source_cn":"你！对，就是你！拿着画笔的这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63C1E8243D317533","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321214010:1":{"text":"장인을 만나고 싶었던 거 아니었어?","source_cn":"你不是很想见这位大师吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1759974B565671AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321214011:1":{"text":"다, 당연하지! 그것 때문에 이런 곳까지 와서 눈사람을 만들고 한 달 동안 그림만 그렸지!","source_cn":"当、当然！我为此跑到荒郊野岭，堆了一周雪人，画了足足一个月！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FC0F1592C719542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321214012:1":{"text":"그럼 그 우상을 만나러 가면 되잖아!","source_cn":"那就去见这位偶像啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x117BB11AD8DBEDE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321214013:1":{"text":"하, 하지만... 내겐 내세울 만한 작품이 없어...","source_cn":"可、可是……我没有拿得出手的作品。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE39AB1611800A39B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321214014:1":{"text":"진짜 시간 낭비 좀 그만하라고!","source_cn":"受不了你们这些有一堆时间可以浪费的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x500E34435F111729","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321214015:1":{"text":"그렇게 시간을 끄는 동안, 네 우상이 떠날 거라는 생각은 해보지 않은 거야?","source_cn":"你拖了这么久，就没想过：你偶像有可能离开吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x920FD6BD0E6768A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321214016:1":{"text":"다... 당연히 걱정되지!","source_cn":"我……我当然担心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD166136378910ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321214017:1":{"text":"만약 이번 기회를 놓친다면 후회하지 않겠어?","source_cn":"万一错过了，你不后悔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30FD51A722140562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321214018:1":{"text":"분명 평생 후회하겠지!","source_cn":"错过的话，我肯定会后悔一辈子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AF494DA780342B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321214019:1":{"text":"놓치게 되면 너희는 평생 다시 만날 수 없을지도 모른다고!","source_cn":"一旦错过了，可能你们这辈子都不一定能再见面了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE54AC81CACA304B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1321214020:1":{"text":"나, 난... 맞아, 하지만...","source_cn":"我，我……确实，可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3B95113EFA00344","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1321214021:1":{"text":"그럼 그렇게 앞뒤 따지지 말고! 지금! 당장 출발해!","source_cn":"那就不要这么瞻前顾后的！现在！立马出发！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE93EDF958A90139F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1321214022:1":{"text":"만약 너에게 일주일의 시간밖에 없었다면, 넌 분명 네가 해야 할 일을 다 마쳤을 거야!","source_cn":"你要是只有一周的时间，肯定要把想做的赶紧做完呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB92ED7FD84070C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1321214023:1":{"text":"우릴 봐, 눈생은 짧으니 어서 들꽃을 보러 가지 않으면 안 돼. 녹고 나면 더 이상의 기회를 없을 거라구!","source_cn":"你看咱，如果不抓紧时间去看眼野花，雪生短暂，化了就再也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE72C89B87528F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1321214024:1":{"text":"시간이 너무 많아서 그래! 언제든 기회가 있을 거라고 생각하니까 그렇게 망설이는 거지!","source_cn":"你们就是时间太多！总觉得还有机会，才这么瞻前顾后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB04D1CF2347EF475","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1321214025:1":{"text":"네, 네 말이 맞아...","source_cn":"你、你说得也对……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13155F73B0558DF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1321214026:1":{"text":"아이 참! 그만 잡아당겨. 이 흔적만 좀 지우고...","source_cn":"唉！你别拉我，我补一下这个画痕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07E1038909E65AF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1321214027:1":{"text":"여기엔, 눈사람을 하나 그려야겠다... 그래! 네가 좋겠어!","source_cn":"这个的话，补一个雪人吧……就是你了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x029324EAD46E5E57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:33::0":{"text":"복구된 그림","source_cn":"经补救的画作","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDCF59C069608D56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:画家派特":{"text":"화가 파이트","source":"画家派特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雪人":{"text":"눈사람","source":"雪人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":30,"localized_text_count":29,"speaker_count":4}}